<title>UK: UK coffee imports rose in July.</title>
<headline>UK coffee imports rose in July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK coffee imports in tonnes issued by UK Customs - coffee not roasted not decaffeinated:</p>
<p>			    Jul    Jun    Jan/Jul 1996   Jan/Jul 1995</p>
<p>  TOTAL		10,657  8,768	66,115	    56,487</p>
<p>  Ivory Coast	   102    508	 1,926	     3,137</p>
